# Europe/London (TZ set in the container).
# One full inbox refresh first thing — opens every chat (~40 min). Also picks up New friends.
0 8 * * * python -m src.jobs.recapture_cron
# Fast reply scan through the day (list-only unless something changed).
# Also refreshes the New friends strip and rematches expired circles there.
# Tick every 5 minutes; the job itself waits a random 30–90 minutes between runs.
*/5 8-23 * * * python -m src.jobs.fast_scan_cron
# LinkedIn reply checks + short feed reacts through the day (plan-jittered).
# Tick every 5 minutes; the job itself waits on the persisted daily plan.
*/5 8-23 * * * python -m src.jobs.linkedin_cron
# LinkedIn Home session: tick often; the job itself waits for a random daytime slot.
*/5 10-20 * * * python -m src.jobs.linkedin_session_cron
# LinkedIn: quiet evening import of 5–10 older chats we do not have yet.
*/5 21-22 * * * python -m src.jobs.linkedin_backfill_cron
